    build: "Build it by asking",
    buildTitle: "Describe the workflow. Review the diff. Apply.",
    buildText:
      "The assistant (⌘J) proposes a new or changed workflow as a card with a graph preview; nothing is saved until you apply it. Connect Claude Code or Codex through MCP and build, run, and fix workflows from that conversation instead.",
